{"title": "Psionic Backlash (passive feature)", "pageid": 40241, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psionic_Backlash_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Reactions", "Passive features", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Psionic_Backlash.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Psionic_Backlash.webp/300px-Psionic_Backlash.webp, /w/images/7/70/Psionic_Backlash.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Psionic_Backlash.webp/300px-Psionic_Backlash.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Psionic_Backlash.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Psionic Backlash</b> is a passive feature and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>. This feature allows a character to, when a nearby enemy casts a spell, use their <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> to deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage for every level of that spell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a nearby enemy casts a spell, you use your <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_(Resource)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction (Resource)\">reaction</a> to deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage for every level of that spell. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></span> </dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Backlash\" title=\"Psionic Backlash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/60px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/80px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Backlash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Psionic_Backlash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Backlash\" title=\"Psionic Backlash\">Psionic Backlash</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">Full-illithid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pactsplitter\" title=\"Pactsplitter\">Pactsplitter</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Z%27rell\" title=\"Z'rell\">Z'rell</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining the following&nbsp;:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentrated_Blast\" title=\"Concentrated Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/38px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/50px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentrated Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentrated_Blast\" title=\"Concentrated Blast\">Concentrated Blast</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When an enemy casts a spell, can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_(Resource)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction (Resource)\">reaction</a> to deal 1d4 <a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\">Psychic</a> per spell level.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714222422\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1594/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15001/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6597/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 274/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1044246/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.241      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   47.241      1 -total\n 49.58%   23.421      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 44.92%   21.221      1 Template:PageSeo\n 18.26%    8.626      4 Template:Icon_link\n 17.36%    8.199      1 Template:R\n 17.17%    8.111      4 Template:Icon_text\n 15.88%    7.500      2 Template:DamageText\n 14.41%    6.810     18 Template:Trim\n 12.62%    5.960      2 Template:Damage_type\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40241-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714222422 and revision id 371293. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}